@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
hide footbox
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
title UnsafeGroupTry：錯誤在哪裡被發現？（模擬 AI 版 vs 修正版）
participant "UnsafeGroupTry\n（呼叫端）" as U
participant "vehicles :\nSampleGroup<HeavyRover>" as G
== 模擬 AI 版：add(SampleSource source) ＋ (T) 轉型 ==
U -> G : add(new SampleTray(4))\n參數型態是 SampleSource → <b>編譯通過</b>
note right of G : (T) source 只得到 unchecked 警告；\n執行時<b>不檢查</b>，樣本盒直接被存進去
U -> G : get(0)
G --> U : 交回的其實是 SampleTray
U -[#C0392B]> U : <color:#C0392B>HeavyRover rover = vehicles.get(0);</color>\n<color:#C0392B>ClassCastException（第 12 行：取出時才失敗）</color>
== 修正版：add(T source)，不轉型 ==
U -[#2E7D32]x G : add(new SampleTray(4))\n<color:#2E7D32>編譯錯誤（第 10 行）：</color>\n<color:#2E7D32>SampleTray cannot be converted to HeavyRover</color>
note over U, G : 錯誤從「執行時、取出那一行」提前到「編譯時、放入那一行」\n——這就是泛型提供的型態安全
@enduml
